<hr>
<p>Keeper,</p>
<p>Tonight. Not the Feast; she's decided. Ilphrin's boy is only with us until the second dimming and she wants him to see it, so, tonight. The pit. Before the first dimming, if you please, and you will please.</p>
<p>The sunskin. Edda, is it? Yes. That one.</p>
<p>Give her a glowstone. And a shiv, a dull one, you'll know the sort. No, she doesn't need anything else. <s>Shoes</s> No.</p>
<p>The warden's beast. Chain it in the middle. Long enough. You know what long enough is. It isn't to be fed. It hasn't been? Good. Then don't.</p>
<p>Oh, and tell her that if she's still standing at the third dimming, we'll let her go. Say it kindly. Make sure she believes you. <s>We needn't</s> Don't bother keeping count of the dimmings.</p>
