   R("Women only","his",14,"There has never been a male witch. Not one, in any story anyone can name.","Mostly women, but there are men among them who keep to the back of the stories."),
   R("Witches walk","his",15,"Witches leave for a time. The young ones especially walk out of the forest and keep walking until it is quiet, and come back when they are ready, or do not. One met on a road is not an exile.","A witch outside the forest has been cast out. The Elders do not let them wander."),
   R("Two paths","his",16,"Outsiders think they are two covens. The ward-witches, etched with runes, hold and mend. The deep-witches change: an arm gone animal, eyes like coals, a shadow that moves late. One coven, two prices.","Two covens, old rivals. The rune-marked and the beast-marked have not spoken in a century."),
