   R("Taken young","his",20,"They are bound as children, girls under ten. An adult who tries the binding shatters. Foundlings, surrendered daughters, a girl found alone in the trees.","A witch is made by a vow, taken grown and by choice, like any coven."),
   R("Where they live","his",22,"A forest realm with no road in, behind ward-rings that make you forget the way. A town that looks like it is failing, around an oak you cannot see the top of.","Deep in the Garrok hills, in caves. Everyone's uncle has seen the smoke.")
