   R("What a ward is for","rel",16,"Wards are the one witch-gift that can be mended. A ward-witch chooses that path because she means to undo as well as do.","Wards are for keeping things out. A ward-witch is a lock, nothing more."),
   R("The eyes come last","arc",17,"Long use of the ward-sight turns the eyes violet and leaves them glowing. The old ones cannot hide it. The young ones still have their own eyes.","The violet eyes are a birthmark of the bloodline. A witch without them was never properly born to it."),
   R("The Long Night","his",18,"Each Long Night the ward-witches renew the rings that hide their realm. The rings fade; the work never ends.","The Long Night is when they leave the forest to hunt. Bar the door.")
