<li><strong>Lies:</strong> she believes nothing and doesn't need to; she measures.</li>
<li><strong>Bribe:</strong> labour, not gold. Talo in bear form can clear a silted channel grate in an hour that would take her keepers a dimming — she values it over coin. (Maelvir, the fire-keeper on the canal wall, is the one who mentions the silt.)</li>
