   if(it.name==="Splint Armor"){it.name="Drow Mail";} },
 bio:`<p><strong>Tazrin</strong>. A drow blade in House livery over dark mail, a longsword at his hip, a shield slung on his back and a hand crossbow on his belt. He is plainly bored.</p>
<p><em>Says:</em> "Steward." / "Mistress." / (to himself, looking at you) a number.</p>
${S(`<p><strong>GM.</strong> House Barrabin blade, the inspection's escort. MM 2024 <strong>Warrior Veteran</strong>, CR 3 (700 XP). Reskin: greatsword → longsword and shield (same dice, AC 17 kept); heavy crossbow → hand crossbow with drow poison; splint reads as drow mail. Drow overlay: Darkvision 120, Fey Ancestry, Sunlight Sensitivity, Darkness and Faerie Fire 1/day. Unlinked.</p>
<p><strong>Wants:</strong> the round over. Has been told sunskins are "alive, worth money" and is doing the sum. Reports to the steward, obeys the priestess. <strong>Fears:</strong> the sum coming out wrong.</p>
<p>If the party says "Ilphrin's purchase", Nedylene sends him to the Hearth to ask: the party has the length of his walk.</p>
<p><strong>If it goes wrong:</strong> draws and blocks the chapel door. Capture over kill: poisoned bolts. If Nedylene drops, he surrenders.</p>`)}`,
 lore:[tell("Doing the sum","ins",12,"He has looked at each of you once and is now looking at nothing. He has worked out what you would fetch."),
   tell("Black-tipped bolts","nat",13,"The bolts at his belt are tarred black at the tip: spider venom that puts you to sleep. He means to take someone alive."),
   tell("Whose word he follows","ins",14,"He answers the steward and watches the priestess. If she went down, he would have nobody left to fight for.")]}
];
